    "description": "* WHAT...Northeast winds 15 to 25 mph with gusts up to 50 mph\nexpected.\n\n* WHERE...Southern Owens Valley, Northwest Plateau, Hualapai\nMountains, Northwest Deserts, Death Valley National Park, Western\nClark and Southern Nye County, Sheep Range, and Spring\nMountains-Red Rock Canyon.\n\n* WHEN...From 8 AM PDT /8 AM MST/ this morning to 11 AM PDT /11 AM\nMST/ Friday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree\nlimbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.",
